  <section class="section research-example" id="process-planning">
    <p class="eyebrow">Example research / Process planning</p>
    <h2>Decision-support software for machining/DED process selection</h2>
    <div class="project-layout">
      <div class="project-story">
        <h3>Problem</h3>
        <p>
          Choosing between machining, DED, and a combined hybrid route requires
          evaluating competing manufacturing strategies. Detailed analysis can
          be time-consuming and depend heavily on specialized process knowledge.
        </p>
        <h3>Approach</h3>
        <p>
          We develop software that analyzes a part’s geometry and rapidly
          evaluates candidate manufacturing routes. By comparing process time,
          material usage, and energy consumption before detailed CAM planning,
          the software helps users identify a suitable strategy.
        </p>
        <h3>Demonstrated result</h3>
        <p>
          The framework enabled faster manufacturing-route evaluation and
          decision-making, reducing the need for extensive preliminary planning.
        </p>
      </div>
      <figure class="wide-figure">
        <img
          src="/images/process-selection.webp"
          width="1800"
          height="1014"
          loading="lazy"
          alt="ARMS process-selection software showing a component decomposed into features for machining, DED, or hybrid manufacturing analysis"
        />
        <figcaption>
          Process-selection software for evaluating machining, DED, and hybrid
          manufacturing routes.
          <a class="figure-enlarge" href="/images/process-selection.webp">
            Open full-size software figure ↗
          </a>
        </figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
    <RelatedPublications ids={["45"]} />
